OL,3,GNEWSAMain road closed after car ends up
OL,4,Ain hedge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA main road in Derbyshire has been
OL,7,Fclosed after a car left the road and
OL,8,Fended up on its side in a hedge.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Police said the A610 was
OL,11,Fclosed after a crash at about 12:50 GMT
OL,12,Fnear Cherrywood Smokehouse.
OL,14,FThe force confirmed the road was closed
OL,15,Fbetween Codnor and Cromford Road at
OL,16,FAldercar.
OL,18,FIt advised motorists to plan
OL,19,Falternative routes and expect delays as
OL,20,Ftraffic is diverted through Heanor.
